<title>HUNGARY: Hungary prelim Q1 1997 trade deficit $690 mln.</title>
<headline>Hungary prelim Q1 1997 trade deficit $690 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's accumulated trade deficit was $690 million in January-March, according to preliminary figures, up from $431.4 million in January-February 1997, the Ministry of Industry, Trade and Tourism (MIT) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY TRADE DEFICIT (in million dollars)</p>
<p>		    Jan-March 1997   Jan-Feb 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Exports	  3,820	     2,380.6	  3,091</p>
<p>    Import	   4,509	     2,812.0	  3,912</p>
<p>    Trade balance    690		 431.4	    821</p>
<p>NOTE - MIT data are based on customs statistics.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
